<section id="home">
  <h2>Welcome to Jordan</h2>
  <p class="subtext">Jordan is a hidden gem of the Middle East that combines ancient history, rich culture, and breathtaking natural landscapes. From the golden deserts of Wadi Rum to the healing waters of the Dead Sea, from the rose-red city of Petra to the warm hospitality of its people, Jordan offers an unforgettable experience like no other.</p>
  <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/Al_Khazneh_Petra_edit_2_%28cropped%29.jpg" alt="Petra">
</section>

<section id="attractions">
  <h2>Top Attractions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Petra:</strong> Discover the rose-red city carved by the Nabataeans.</li>
    <li><strong>Wadi Rum:</strong> A dramatic desert landscape perfect for adventures.</li>
    <li><strong>The Dead Sea:</strong> Float in the Earth’s lowest point.</li>
    <li><strong>Amman:</strong> A capital blending old and new.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="cuisine">
  <h2>Jordanian Cuisine</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Mansaf:</strong> The national dish of Jordan.</li>
    <li><strong>Maqluba:</strong> A flipped rice and meat dish.</li>
    <li><strong>Knafeh:</strong> A sweet, syrupy dessert with cheese.</li>
    <li><strong>Hummus & Falafel:</strong> Street food staples.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="culture">
  <h2>Culture & Traditions</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Hospitality:</strong> Guests are always welcomed with open hearts.</li>
    <li><strong>Dress:</strong> Traditional attire and keffiyeh.</li>
    <li><strong>Dabke:</strong> A traditional dance of joy.</li>
    <li><strong>Festivals:</strong> Jerash Festival and more.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="stay">
  <h2>Where to Stay</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Luxury Hotels:</strong> 5-star stays in Amman, Dead Sea, Aqaba.</li>
    <li><strong>Bedouin Camps:</strong> Authentic desert experience in Wadi Rum.</li>
    <li><strong>Guesthouses:</strong> Family-run stays in rural villages.</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="itinerary">
  <h2>Suggested Itineraries</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>3-Day Adventure:</strong> Petra & Wadi Rum</li>
    <li><strong>1-Week Northern Discovery:</strong> Jerash to Dead Sea</li>
    <li><strong>Religious Trail:</strong> Baptism Site, Mount Nebo, Madaba</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="testimonials">
