<section id="final">
  <h2>The Journey Begins</h2>
  <p class="subtext">In a land where the sun carves its name on the mountains, where the sands whisper ancient secrets, where history breathes, and hearts open wide like the desert... Jordan is not just visited — It’s lived, loved, and etched into memory.</p>
